    <item>
      <title>离了大谱！ICLR 2026 审稿竟有21%是AI“代笔”，学术圈也“塌房”了？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/iclr-2026-21ai-20251117144006993-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 14:40:06 +0800</pubDate>
